WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.705
Welcome to Module 7.

00:00:01.705 --> 00:00:07.759
Today: your stock, your customers, and di money wey people dey owe you.

00:00:08.459 --> 00:00:12.328
Write how many you get and how many you don sell.

00:00:12.328 --> 00:00:18.408
Set reorder level — when stock reach dat number, go buy more before e finish.

00:00:19.108 --> 00:00:21.233
Keep list of your customers.

00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:23.585
Know di ones wey dey come back.

00:00:23.585 --> 00:00:26.544
Na dem be di backbone of your business.

00:00:27.244 --> 00:00:31.287
Credit na where plenty small business dey lose money.

00:00:31.287 --> 00:00:33.880
Write who owe, how much, and when.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:37.160
Check am every week and collect your money.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:44.066
Your cash go dey flow, your stock go dey correct, and nobody go chop your money.

00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:46.986
Start your debt list today.

00:00:46.986 --> 00:00:49.206
See you for di last module!
